# The surface for step_wood.obj: the crate's planed timber. Read through the obj's `mtllib` line,
# like every other surface in the sample.
# **`bump`, not `map_Bump`** — Model I/O's OBJ reader recognises only this spelling.
newmtl timber
Kd 1 1 1
Ks 0 0 0
# planed timber, as the crates: Ns 24 becomes roughness 0.53.
Ns 24
map_Kd crate.png
bump crate_normal.png
